      "beat_id": "B02",
      "t_start": 10.0,
      "estimated_duration_s": 14.0,
      "narration_text": "level 1. the trick is AskUserQuestion. instead of you prompting Claude badly, Claude asks you the questions. prompt it like this: help me do X. use AskUserQuestion first. Claude gives you three to five questions. you click the answers. the more you say, the better the output. that one line makes you better at AI than most people who call themselves prompt engineers.",
